irs, fragile pieces..."></textarea></label></div></div><div class="booking-submit"><button class="btn btn-primary">Request my move <span>↗</span></button><small>We’ll review your details and confirm the final estimate with you.</small></div></form><aside class="quote-card"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR ESTIMATE</span><h3>A clearer picture,<br>before moving day.</h3><div class="estimate-lines"><div><span>Starting move estimate</span><b id="estimate-base">Rs. 5,000</b></div><div><span>Distance allowance</span><b>Rs. 4,000</b></div><div><span>Selected extras</span><b id="estimate-extras">Rs. 0</b></div></div><div class="estimate-total"><span>Estimated total</span><b id="estimate-total">Rs. 9,000</b></div><p>Estimate based on typical local distance. Our team confirms your tailored quote after reviewing the details.</p><div class="quote-promise">✦ &nbsp;No hidden surprises</div></aside></div></section><?php }
